    "FARM BOUNDARY EVIDENCE EVENT": {
      "category": "Other",
      "description": "Farmer/agent-submitted geotagged boundary evidence (photos/videos of plot boundary markers). GPS embedded in the images is extracted (exiftool); the convex hull forms the approx boundary polygon; the backend creates/updates the farm + plot record (SunMint Farms sheet -> plots/index.geojson -> impact map). CONTRACT: omit Plot ID when unknown - the backend auto-assigns PL-###; NEVER send an empty '- Plot ID:' line (the GAS parser regex swallows the newline and captures the next label - fixed tokenomics #458). Join Media URLs with '; '. Include the live UI fields (Is New Farm, Media Count, Captured At, Device GPS) plus Extracted GPS and Area Hectares when available. See agentic_ai_context/SUNMINT_TREE_PHOTO_PROCESSING.md section 6.",
      "canonical_labels": [
        "Farm Name",
        "Is New Farm",
        "Boundary Type",
        "Media URLs",
        "Media Count",
        "Captured At",
        "Device GPS",
        "Extracted GPS",
        "Area Hectares",
        "Submission Source"
      ],
      "required_fields": [
        "Farm Name",
        "Media URLs"
      ],
      "dapp_page": "limites-da-fazenda/index.html"
    },
