    "TREE PLANTING EVENT": {
      "category": "Other",
      "description": "Record a tree planting with photo and location. CONTRACT: send BOTH the canonical Location (e.g. -3.094431, -52.095225; decimal, S/W negative - satisfies Edgar validation) AND Latitude/Longitude decimal fields (the GAS parser fills the SunMint Tree Planting tab lat/lng columns from these lines). Missing Location => validator rejects; missing Latitude/Longitude => parser writes blank lat/lng. Species strings are not standardized ('Cacau - Hybrid' pt vs 'Cacao' en) - use the exact string the farm lead specifies. See agentic_ai_context/SUNMINT_TREE_PHOTO_PROCESSING.md section 7.",
      "canonical_labels": [
        "Tree Count",
        "Location",
        "Latitude",
        "Longitude",
